Module crossroads "The road between" {
  Description "A crossroads on the moor between Merrowdale to the north and the Bowl of Ammerlin to the south.".
  Place moor "The moor road" is region.
  Place heath "the heath" is wilderness within moor at 0, 0.
  Place crossroads "the crossroads on the moor" is room within heath at 0, 0 outdoors.
  Company party "Your company" of 3 at crossroads.
  Initially Set quantity(party, gold) to 20. Initially Set quantity(party, rations) to 4.
  Observe crossroads_scene at crossroads when true "A fingerpost at a crossroads on the heath. North, MERROW. South, AMMERLIN, and under it someone has scratched: MIND THE MUD.".
}
